{"id":"9f84d5a885cb119f","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-universal-closure.md","title":"df-universal-closure","display":"df-universal-closure — df-universal-closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-universal-closure","aliases":["57-df-universal-closure"],"display":"df-universal-closure — df-universal-closure","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-universal-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-universal-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-universal-closure — df-universal-closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\varphi_i\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\varphi_i\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x_\\varphi\">\\(\\vec x_\\varphi\\)</span> 是依固定变量枚举递增排列的自由变量列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{All},\\mathrm{UC}\">\\(\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{All},\\mathrm{UC}\\)</span> 是下述有限列递归函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top\\coloneqq\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0),\\qquad\\bot\\coloneqq\\neg\\top.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top\\coloneqq\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0),\\qquad\\bot\\coloneqq\\neg\\top.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\top,&amp;\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n,\\psi\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle)\\land\\psi&amp;&amp; (n\\geq1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,&amp;\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n,\\psi\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle)\\lor\\psi&amp;&amp;(n\\geq1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{All}(\\langle\\rangle,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,&amp;\n\\mathrm{All}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x_1\\mathrm{All}(\\langle x_2,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle,\\varphi)\\quad(n\\geq1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{UC}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}(\\vec x_\\varphi,\\varphi),&amp;\\forall(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UC}(\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\top,&amp;\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n,\\psi\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle)\\land\\psi&amp;&amp; (n\\geq1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\bot,&amp;\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n,\\psi\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle)\\lor\\psi&amp;&amp;(n\\geq1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{All}(\\langle\\rangle,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi,&amp;\n\\mathrm{All}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle,\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x_1\\mathrm{All}(\\langle x_2,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle,\\varphi)\\quad(n\\geq1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{UC}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}(\\vec x_\\varphi,\\varphi),&amp;\\forall(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UC}(\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>新文件集中补齐原逻辑程序条目使用的空体、空目标、有限合取和全称闭包；不另增加原始逻辑构造子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi,\\varphi_i\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\mathrm{free}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]；$\\vec x_\\varphi$ 是依固定变量枚举递增排列的自由变量列。$\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{All},\\mathrm{UC}$ 是下述有限列递归函数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi,\\varphi_i\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\mathrm{free}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]；$\\vec x_\\varphi$ 是依固定变量枚举递增排列的自由变量列。$\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{All},\\mathrm{UC}$ 是下述有限列递归函数。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"f2434afaa125d50e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi,\\varphi_i\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\mathrm{free}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]；$\\vec x_\\varphi$ 是依固定变量枚举递增排列的自由变量列。$\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{All},\\mathrm{UC}$ 是下述有限列递归函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi,\\varphi_i\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"x_i\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x_\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{All},\\mathrm{UC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\top\\coloneqq\\forall x_0(x_0\\doteq x_0),\\qquad\\bot\\coloneqq\\neg\\top.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\top,&\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n,\\psi\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{And}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle)\\land\\psi&& (n\\geq1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\bot,&\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\varphi\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n,\\psi\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Or}(\\langle\\varphi_1,\\ldots,\\varphi_n\\rangle)\\lor\\psi&&(n\\geq1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{All}(\\langle\\rangle,\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\varphi,&\n\\mathrm{All}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle,\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\forall x_1\\mathrm{All}(\\langle x_2,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle,\\varphi)\\quad(n\\geq1),\\\\\n\\mathrm{UC}(\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{All}(\\vec x_\\varphi,\\varphi),&\\forall(\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{UC}(\\varphi).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1746,"backlinks":[{"id":"3a7fb08fa07ece64","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PropFml}_S$，原子赋值及其延拓 $v^*$ 见 [[57-df-prop-satisfaction]]；$\\mathrm{Lit}_S$ 见 [[57-df-literal]]。有限列的拼接记为 $\\frown$；$\\langle a\\in\\vec s:P(a)\\rangle$ 保留原列次序和满足 $P$ 的各次出现。$\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{Or}$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]，下式只对非空列使用它们。"},{"id":"4ff8d80549e0fa98","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{PropFml}_S$；$\\mathrm{Lit}_S$ 见 [[57-df-literal]]，$\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{Or}$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。使用 [[57-df-cnf]] 的首次出现原子列 $\\vec p=A(\\varphi)$、$k=|\\vec p|\\ge1$、二进制位 $b_{k,r}(i)$ 和原子赋值 $v_{\\varphi,r}$。"},{"id":"4ed02595a2cb4caa","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定互异变量列 $\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle$；$\\mathrm{free}$ 见 [[57-df-free-variable]]，$\\mathrm{All}$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]，$\\models$ 见 [[57-df-logical-consequence]]。$S_0$ 和 $\\vec x$ 是本二元接口的显式环境参数。"},{"id":"20aaef29b45de654","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\geq0$，$B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]。$\\mathrm{Or},\\mathrm{UC},\\bot$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。$\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n$ 表示闭合负子句；分解为有序目标列时保留这一列作为归结状态的显式表示，不能从集合表示中推测选择位置。"},{"id":"116e7c4b27a69d8e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B,B_i\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$，见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]；$n\\in\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{And},\\mathrm{UC}$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。程序箭头 $\\leftarrow$ 是完整全称闭包的缩写，不是待另解释的关系符号。保留原 Horn 类只含一个正头的约定。"},{"id":"a9a7faa02ecae403","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$\\mathrm{QFree}$ 见 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]，有限全称前缀函数 $\\mathrm{All}$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。"},{"id":"43b2728e68e05836","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"对每个输入及每个 $i\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec e)$，固定互异的新符号 $F_{\\varphi,i}\\notin S$，元数 $r_i=|\\vec z|+|\\vec y_i|$；$r_i=0$ 时为常量。此整个符号选择族是算法环境参数。同时代入见 [[57-df-simultaneous-substitution]]，有限全称前缀见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。"},{"id":"8d38fda38311314d","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_0\\subseteq S$ 为相容子语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S$，$n\\ge1$，$P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S_0)$。$\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle$ 是互异变量列；$\\mathrm{ImplDef}$、$\\mathrm{ExplDef}$ 使用 [[57-df-implicit-definability]]、[[57-df-explicit-definability]] 中同一 $S_0,\\vec x$ 环境。$\\mathrm{All}$ 取 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。"},{"id":"2830229fa8f44c6a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为只含常量及有限正元函数符号的一阶字母表，$\\mathrm{Rel}_S=\\varnothing$，结构载体非空。$\\mathcal K$ 为 $S$-结构类；$\\mathrm{Hom}$、子结构、$\\mathrm{UC}$ 及集合族直积分别取 [[57-df-homomorphism]]、[[57-df-substructure]]、[[57-df-universal-closure]]、[[57-df-indexed-product]]。$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为任意集合指标结构族，允许 $I=\\varnothing$；$D=\\prod_{i\\in I}|\\mathfrak A_i|$。下面给出其结构直积解释 $J$；$c$、$f$、$n$ 遍历各自符号类型，$\\vec a\\in D^n$。类表达式用背景 ZFC 的类模式解释；$\\mathcal K\\in\\mathrm{Variety}$ 是类参数上的谓词记号，并不声称真类是集合的元素。"},{"id":"2796f266f02fcd26","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为纯函数语言（允许常量，无关系符号）；$\\Phi$ 为一组普遍闭包的等式句子：$\\Phi\\subseteq\\{\\operatorname{All}(\\vec x,s\\doteq t):s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\ \\vec x\\text{ 为覆盖 }\\mathrm{var}(s)\\cup\\mathrm{var}(t)\\text{ 的互异有限变量列}\\}$。$\\operatorname{All}$ 取 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。$K=\\mathrm{Mod}(\\Phi)$；假定存在 $\\mathfrak A_0\\in K$ 且 $\\bigl||\\mathfrak A_0|\\bigr|\\ge2$。$X$ 为集合，且 $X\\ne\\emptyset$ 或 $\\mathrm{Const}_S\\ne\\emptyset$。$\\mathrm{FreeObj}$ 保留 [[57-df-free-model]] 的生成集字面包含约定。"},{"id":"d2f6edd30be06d05","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)$ 为显式有序目标，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。$\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)$、$\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)$ 见 [[57-df-sld-resolution]]；原无参数 $\\mathrm{CAS}$ 在当前固定 $P,G$ 环境下是这个集合的缩写。所有程序和目标矩阵原子均为关系符号应用，不含内建等号；假定 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]] 的 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$。$\\mathrm{UC},\\mathrm{And}$ 和逻辑后承见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]、[[57-df-logical-consequence]]。"},{"id":"e64933cc4ccfc533","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，$G=(\\leftarrow A_1,\\ldots,A_k)$ 为显式有序目标，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]、[[57-df-goal-clause]]。$\\mathrm{CAS}(P,G)$、$\\mathrm{SLD\\text{-}Refutation}(P,G)$ 见 [[57-df-sld-resolution]]；原无参数 $\\mathrm{CAS}$ 在当前固定 $P,G$ 环境下是这个集合的缩写。所有程序和目标矩阵原子均为关系符号应用，不含内建等号；假定 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]] 的 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$。$\\mathrm{UC},\\mathrm{And}$ 和逻辑后承见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]、[[57-df-logical-consequence]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-ax-substitution-schema]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-family]]\n[[57-df-finite-subset]]\n[[57-df-finite]]\n[[57-df-function-restriction]]\n[[57-df-function-symbol]]\n[[57-df-hilbert-derivabl